            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF144 supports <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/ScreenOrientation/lock\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">ScreenOrientation.lock()</code></a> and <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/ScreenOrientation/unlock\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">ScreenOrientation.unlock()</code></a> in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1983483\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1983483</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This adds a release note.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3417439803\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41142\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/41142/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41142\">#41142</a></p>",
