        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87750369?u=ccc1f52005708ae16bcb50e325e02145bff0ef7d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">The PR does following changes:</p>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Uses livesample macro instead of GHLivesample macro by embedding the code in the content file</li>\n<li>Adds more color spaces in the output color table</li>\n<li>Adds text color input field. This will help users convert their custom color  in various formats and color spaces.</li>\n<li>Also, makes small tweeks to the other color mixer tool.</li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The new look of the tool:</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/87750369/491867472-f74b2c52-dc37-46a0-9cc3-cba19a51818e.jpg?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..3bBP9eiMsjvZXyjNnEqsQTCgwYEehZ1Bd6QOdukIvWE\"><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/87750369/491867472-f74b2c52-dc37-46a0-9cc3-cba19a51818e.jpg?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..3bBP9eiMsjvZXyjNnEqsQTCgwYEehZ1Bd6QOdukIvWE\" alt=\"5\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a></p>",
